OrderStatus Enum
Create an enum named OrderStatus to represent the current state of an order. The recommended values
are:
PENDING
IN_KITCHEN
COMPLETED
CANCELLED
An order should normally start as PENDING. When it is added to the kitchen queue, its status becomes
IN_KITCHEN. When it is processed, its status becomes COMPLETED. If the order is cancelled, its status
becomes CANCELLED. The program should not use plain String values for order status.Restaurant
